WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.050
You're worthless!

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:04.640
Didn't I tell you to get 
this place clean by dusk?!

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:07.110
Those slave traders tricked us.

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:09.360
What an unbearably creepy girl.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:53.570
<i>From now on, you must live here.</i>

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:09.160
<i>I shall play the best role of all</i>

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:15.830
<i>The saddest role where one kills the most</i>

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:22.920
<i>Even at the ends of this square ocean, 
people change and are replaced</i>

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:28.910
<i>You forget that you're 
playing a role in this world</i>

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:32.280
<i>Everyone is just a bird in a cage</i>

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:35.960
<i>We all look forward to the day we can escape</i>

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:39.170
<i>And once it's within our grasp</i>

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:42.310
<i>The great big sky overwhelms us</i>

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:46.830
<i>MYSTERIOUS</i>

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:52.870
<i>Call out the name and bring calm</i>

00:01:52.870 --> 00:02:02.870
<i>No one can stop your MYSTERIOUS</i>

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:11.300
<i>My MYSTERIOUS</i>

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:21.970
<i>Now, I shall play the best role of all</i>

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:23.990
Raven of the Inner Palace

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:27.720
<i>Deep in the inner palace,</i>

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:29.120
Ye Ming Palace

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:31.120
<i>there lives a consort known 
as the Raven Consort.</i>

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:36.130
<i>She holds a special position. 
Despite her title of consort,</i>

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.610
<i>she does not perform nighttime duties.</i>

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:41.770
<i>Though she lives in the inner palace,</i>

00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:45.600
<i>she has no contact with the emperor.</i>

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:49.230
<i>It is said that she can use 
mysterious arts...</i>

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.190
Your Highness, you have guests.

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:59.450
I have a request.

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:05.790
I am Huaniang, 
daughter of the Yun family.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:09.750
<b>Episode 3 
The Whistle</b>

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.940
I am the consort from
 the Yuanqian Palace.

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:10.210
As Second Consort, you are second
 only to the empress herself.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:16.210
Indeed. That said, His Majesty 
does not yet have an empress.

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:15.170
Second Consort 
Yun Huaniang

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:18.340
What do you want?

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:23.290
His Majesty seems to 
visit you periodically.

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:25.720
Why is that?

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:30.980
Will you become my consort?

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.580
I know not what he wants.

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:37.610
He visits briefly and is gone 
before I know it.

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:43.120
He is not making any requests of you, then?

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:44.950
He did make a request once.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:47.290
I shan't tell you what it was.

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:50.500
It wasn't a request for 
a death curse, was it?

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:53.670
It would be simpler for the emperor 
to have someone beheaded

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.500
rather than to have me curse them.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:04:00.510
There are those within the inner palace 
who do not seem to understand even that.

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:04.010
His Majesty executed the empress dowager.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:08.220
Some believe he asked
 the Raven Consort to curse her.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:11.770
Why would they think that?

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:15.300
It stems from jealousy, I assume.

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:16.270
Jealousy?

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:22.280
His Majesty rarely visits his consorts, 
but he makes frequent trips to see you.

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:24.650
I am not performing nighttime duties.

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:26.500
No. After all, you're the Raven Consort.

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:29.660
Are you only here to 
inquire about my affairs?

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.730
I came to confirm your nature.

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:34.640
After all, looking after the 
inner palace is my responsibility.

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.250
I am glad to have met you.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.790
I am relieved.

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:45.010
Do you not have a request for me?

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:47.420
I will be back tonight.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:52.400
The Flower Princess is so pretty.

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:53.540
Flower Princess?

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:57.150
She always keeps a 
flower whistle in her sash,

00:04:57.150 --> 00:05:00.030
even though it's probably bad luck.

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:01.570
Is it?

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:04.110
You mean you don't know?

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.860
I'm not <i>entirely </i>unfamiliar with it...

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:10.960
People hang them from their eaves 
at the end of winter

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:13.330
to mourn those who passed away that year.

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:17.860
They say the dead return on winds 
signaling the arrival of spring

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:19.630
and blow the whistles.

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:22.500
Why does she wear one, then?

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:25.220
Apparently, she won't tell anyone why.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:25.960
I see.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:29.930
Also, His Majesty and Lady Huaniang 
are childhood friends.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:35.430
Lady Huaniang is three years older and 
the granddaughter of Prime Minster Yun.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:37.190
Prime Minister 
Yun Yongde

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:38.400
That's how they became playmates.

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:43.530
Are you carrying tributes for the emperor?

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:46.110
If you're headed to the palace, 
give me a ride.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.530
Le House Eunuch
 Dan Hai

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:51.540
You're from Shuzhou? That's a long trip.

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:55.230
I heard a lot of people died
 during the recent upheaval.

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:57.050
That was three years ago.

00:05:57.050 --> 00:05:59.170
A strange faith spread among the people.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.920
Its believers caused an uprising.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.920
Really? And then?

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:07.670
Thanks again!

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:10.010
You returned on a merchant's carriage?

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:14.780
Dan Hai, do you even realize you're 
a eunuch in the emperor's service?

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:17.780
My job is gathering information.

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:21.690
Unlike a certain uptight someone, 
I like to be flexible in my thinking

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:25.230
so I can acquire useful 
information on the daily.

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.660
Hey, where are you going?

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:29.070
To the Ye Ming Palace.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:32.100
I've been tasked with 
protecting the Raven Consort.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:34.080
The Raven Consort, huh?

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:41.960
Hongqiao, you can rest now.

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:54.870
Your Highness, I told you I'd bring
 you water if you needed any!

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.640
I can get my own water.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:58.500
But you've got me.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.540
I've managed on my own until now.

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:01.730
I don't need help.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:05.110
Then there's no point in me being here.

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:07.360
It's rather lively in here.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:12.610
You've decided to keep both
 of them at the Ye Ming Palace?

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:15.310
No, actually. I can't keep 
them around forever.

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:16.740
I do not foresee any issues.

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:19.150
The Raven Consort does not 
keep ladies-in-waiting.

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:20.750
I only need one servant, as well.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.370
Why?

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:25.470
That's none of your business.

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:27.530
You're the one who caused 
all of this to begin with.

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:30.880
All this trouble started 
after you started visiting.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:33.390
You might be right.

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:35.510
I heard Huaniang paid you a visit.

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:38.440
Only because you keep coming here.

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:41.020
You should go see your consorts.

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:45.690
I do visit them, just often enough 
to keep them from complaining.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:49.150
You needn't visit me, then. Begone.

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:52.150
Good evening.

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:59.500
If you have a request for the 
Raven Consort, I should leave.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.770
No, you are welcome to stay.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:09.320
I had this whistle made
 for a certain person,

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:11.220
but it's never made a sound.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.810
Why do you think that is?

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:21.480
Does it remain silent because 
he won't return to me?

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:24.100
Who is this person of which you speak?

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:26.980
He was my lover.

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:36.110
His name was Ou Xuanyou.
 He passed away three years ago.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:41.420
I waited for his soul to return,

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:44.580
but the whistle never made a sound.

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:49.380
Why is that? Why won't he return to me?

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:55.700
Can you make this whistle sound?

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.510
Can you summon him?

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:59.510
Is that your request?

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:02.520
Yes.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:05.890
Very well. I shall attempt to call his soul.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:07.400
You can do that?

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:11.680
I can only summon a soul from paradise once.

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:12.990
Keep that in mind.

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:18.210
Is Xuanyou his courtesy name?

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:18.930
Yes.

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:19.740
And his given name?

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:20.780
Xiao.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:54.540
I cannot call him.

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:55.400
What?

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:59.550
I cannot find the soul you're 
looking for in paradise.

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:02.160
There is no response to my summons.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:03.010
But...

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:05.790
Is Xuanyou perhaps still alive?

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:10.020
If not that, there must be some other
 reason I cannot summon his soul.

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:13.780
How did he die?

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:17.550
Three years ago, Ou Xuanyou 
was appointed to Shuzhou.

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:20.820
He lost his life in the uprising 
that took place there.

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:26.370
At the time, an odd faith known as
 the Yue Doctrine had become popular.

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:31.720
A man named Yue Xiaweng 
was revered as a living god.

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:35.820
Allegedly, he could predict the future 
and accurately guess the past,

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:38.950
but I hear he was not 
a practitioner of magic.

00:10:39.310 --> 00:10:42.820
I wish to know more about this Yue Xiaweng.

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:44.470
Dan Hai.

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:47.540
He is my ears.

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:50.920
I just happened to make some 
good connections in Shuzhou.

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:54.220
The merchants I became friendly 
with will surely be useful.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.560
This is the Yuanqian Palace.

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:05.560
Yuanqian Palace

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:08.750
You should plant flowers 
at the Ye Ming Palace, too.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.730
Flowers don't grow in that place.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:12.700
Would you like to take one?

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:26.590
Thank you, Your Highness.

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:27.850
No need to thank me.

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:35.340
You both look wonderful.

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:41.790
We received various
 items from a merchant.

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:45.300
Among them are unusual wares 
from countries across the sea.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:46.970
Would you like to see them?

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:49.980
It is fine. I would like to know 
more about Ou Xuanyou.

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:56.970
I suppose you could say Xuanyou was 
like boiled water that had cooled.

00:11:57.470 --> 00:12:00.050
Warm and gentle.

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:05.370
Though he could be passionate at times, 
he never used that heat to burn anyone.

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:12.190
But, boiled water is only the perfect 
temperature for a short time.

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:15.450
He, too, was gone before I knew it.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:18.250
Cooled boiled water is good for you.

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:24.990
Perhaps his soul is lost in Shuzhou.

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:27.560
He could be careless, after all.

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:34.900
What do you think of His Majesty?

00:12:35.640 --> 00:12:37.020
What do you mean?

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:42.220
He seems to have changed 
some since he met you.

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:44.920
I never know what he is thinking.

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:47.660
He's expressionless, unsociable, and rude.

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:51.850
He feels like winter.

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:57.280
Silent and still, and though
 there is warmth in the sunlight,

00:12:57.280 --> 00:12:59.540
something hides in the shadows.

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:04.680
As a child, His Majesty laughed 
and became upset freely.

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:09.070
He stopped expressing his emotions 
because of his mother's death

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:10.920
and what happened with Ding Lan.

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:11.930
Ding Lan?

00:13:14.130 --> 00:13:17.690
His Majesty made this whistle for me.

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:20.040
He made that?

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:22.490
He's skilled with his hands.

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:28.640
He studied under a eunuch named 
Ding Lan, whom he loved very much.

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:30.830
But Ding Lan died a horrible death.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:34.620
You mustn't mention his name 
in His Majesty's presence.

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:42.500
Yua Xiaweng is long since dead.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:46.390
He was sentenced to whipping 
and banishment from the province,

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:49.170
but he died before he 
received a hundred lashes.

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:52.430
What were his prophecies and arts like?

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:56.090
Finding lost items, conjuring illusions, 
and performing transformations.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:59.770
No one knows if they were 
real or fake, though.

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:03.190
Some say there was more 
than one Yue Xiaweng.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:04.610
What do you mean?

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:07.990
Sometimes he seemed like another person,

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:10.370
as though he was possessed.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:11.660
Possessed...

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:13.740
Also, this is just a rumor as well,

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:17.070
but he was apparently a member
 of the previous dynasty.

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:20.990
That's all we learned.

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:22.930
I'll let you know if we learn more.

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:25.100
Don't throw things at me.

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:26.090
They're dried apricots.

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.630
Are you trying to feed monkeys?

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:32.890
Huaniang said you'd changed recently.

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:34.620
Changed? Changed how?

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:35.520
I don't know.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:38.770
She must be mistaken.

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:44.650
I have a request for the Raven Consort.

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:47.320
Please come to the 
Yuanqian Palace as soon as you can.

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:49.910
You want me to find a lost item?

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:54.670
One of the items we received from a 
merchant the other day has gone missing.

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:56.910
That's all? I thought this
 would be more serious.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:58.850
It <i>is</i> serious.

00:14:58.850 --> 00:15:01.130
Those items belong to the emperor.

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:04.290
We'll be made to take responsibility
 for anything missing.

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:06.880
Take responsibility? You mean executed?

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:10.310
One of the court ladies has gone missing.

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:13.300
Are you saying she fled 
with the missing item?

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:16.890
She wasn't the type of person 
to do anything so audacious.

00:15:17.320 --> 00:15:20.810
But recently, she's been acting strange.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:22.440
Acting strange?

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:25.820
Sometimes she acted like a different person.

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:29.610
Sometimes he seemed like another person.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:32.450
Take me to this court lady's room.

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:40.450
What is her name?

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:42.070
Ye Qingcheng.

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:05.400
Stay where you are.

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:20.290
Are you Ye Qingcheng?

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:22.790
Who can say? I do not know her name.

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.690
Who are you?

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:26.750
Are you associated with Yue Xiaweng?

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.920
Oh? What makes you say that?

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.500
You've tamed my raven.

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:33.490
That's not something 
an ordinary person can do.

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:37.050
And judging by the characters 
on that jar, you're a sorcerer.

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:38.730
I see.

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:44.620
I am Bingyue, Luan Bingyue,

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:45.830
Raven Consort.

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:46.820
Luan?

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:48.510
Like you.

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:50.230
Isn't that right, Raven Consort?

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:54.030
My name is Liu Shouxue, not Luan.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:56.110
I'm not interested in fake names.

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:57.940
Your blood calls to me.

00:16:57.940 --> 00:17:00.500
It tells me you're family.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.780
I'm impressed you survived.

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:07.280
I was captured and beheaded.

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:13.260
Whose soul is trapped inside that jar?

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:18.760
It would seem you wish to summon the soul 
of a man who died in the uprising at Shuzhou.

00:17:19.460 --> 00:17:20.740
Could it be?

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:24.540
Souls that die far away from 
their homelands become lost.

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:27.940
I gather them up and seal 
them inside this jar.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:31.410
I originally thought 
to make them my servants,

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:34.190
but I unexpectedly found 
another use for them.

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:35.680
What do you mean?

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:38.370
You may have the soul of Ou Xuanyou.

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:41.080
But in exchange, I have a request.

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.580
A request?

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:47.080
It's the reason I came to the inner palace.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.680
What is your request?

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:51.680
Why did you come here?

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:53.790
If you'll do as I ask, then I'll tell you.

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:55.620
But, if you can't...

00:17:55.620 --> 00:17:57.750
Then I'll kill this woman and flee.

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:59.380
This lost soul will never return.

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:00.100
What will you do?

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:02.100
No need to threaten me. 
I will hear you out.

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:05.310
Put down your blade!

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:27.830
Ou Xuanyou.

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:36.970
Wen Ying, how is she?

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:40.010
Merely unconscious.

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:42.060
I see. Thank you.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:49.130
Raven Consort, why do you allow yourself 
to remain cooped up in the inner palace?

00:18:49.130 --> 00:18:52.640
Everything could be yours if you desired.

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:59.070
Did you hear what he just said?

00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:01.070
Hear what?

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:04.300
I'm going back to the Yuanqian Palace.

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:12.630
This is the soul of Ou Xuanyou.

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:20.240
It's warm.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:24.470
Not too hot, like cooled boiled water.

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:29.690
Wait. Just a little longer.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.350
Xuanyou!

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:58.540
He will return to you again in spring.

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:09.520
Huaniang gave me this for summoning a soul.

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:12.370
She threatened to throw it away 
if I refused to accept it.

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:14.330
There's no resisting Huaniang.

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:15.860
You should accept it.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.980
Why is she at the inner palace?

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:23.990
After Xuanyou's death, 
Huaniang had nowhere to go.

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:28.330
Since her lover was dead, she had no choice 
but to marry into another family.

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:32.820
But she refused to consider it, 
so I granted her this position.

00:20:34.050 --> 00:20:39.270
She instructed me to wear those clothes 
and visit her at the Yuanqian Palace.

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:42.380
I'm sure you'll make good companions.

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:47.230
The Raven Consort does not gossip 
over tea with other consorts.

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:51.340
I was empty once.

00:20:51.340 --> 00:20:54.770
It was the previous Raven Consort 
who filled that void.

00:20:55.250 --> 00:21:00.020
She took me in after I lost my mother 
and was sold by slave traders.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:04.660
She said, "From now on, you must live here."

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:06.530
She said that was my destiny.

00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:09.870
She gave me a new name and 
taught me how to do everything,

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:12.850
such as how to read and write,
 how to speak as I do,

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:14.570
and how to use the Raven Consort's arts.

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:17.300
She made me promise
 I would never take pity

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:20.460
on those who made requests 
of the Raven Consort.

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:21.800
Why is that?

00:21:22.560 --> 00:21:24.550
Because it would tear me apart.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:28.180
Allowing my emotions to be 
affected would cloud my judgment.

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:31.250
Perhaps she was right,

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.520
but Huaniang said you were 
the kindest person she's ever met.

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:42.170
This will go well with the
 clothes Huaniang gave you.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:43.650
I don't—

00:21:43.010 --> 00:21:44.610
If you don't want it, then throw it away.

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:47.990
You're all terrible.

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:54.120
Don't come back here.

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:56.370
Don't be so angry.

00:21:56.840 --> 00:21:59.100
This is no place for an emperor.

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:01.500
The Raven Consort and emperor 
are like oil and water.

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:03.220
What does that mean?

00:22:06.380 --> 00:22:12.350
<i>My fate had tainted</i>

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:19.580
<i>The heavily falling snow black</i>

00:22:20.240 --> 00:22:26.060
<i>The sun shines in gradually</i>

00:22:26.060 --> 00:22:33.240
<i>And freshly melts it away 
with its summer warmth</i>

00:22:33.830 --> 00:22:40.000
<i>The dream you saw in your eternal sleep</i>

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:45.150
<i>I'll do whatever I can to make it come true</i>

00:22:45.150 --> 00:22:47.700
<i>(I want to help you, it's true)</i>

00:22:47.700 --> 00:22:53.690
<i>Because you made your wish to me</i>

00:22:53.690 --> 00:23:00.760
<i>Just like the sun shining 
through the darkness</i>

00:23:01.340 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>The bouquet of light</i>

00:23:06.330 --> 00:23:14.780
<i>That you had given me</i>

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:23.470
<i>Still connects the seasons 
that will never meet</i>

00:23:23.470 --> 00:23:27.810
<i>The proof of this pain</i>

00:23:25.020 --> 00:23:25.850
Wei Qing.

00:23:25.850 --> 00:23:26.590
Yes, Master.

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:30.030
Get in touch with Xue Yuyong 
of the Winter Palace.

00:23:27.810 --> 00:23:34.540
<i>Will it be able to stay the snow 
that falls in the summer?</i>

00:23:30.910 --> 00:23:33.750
Tell him I have questions 
about the Raven Consort.

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Episode 4</b>

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>The Skylark Princess</b>
